<h1 id="requirements-and-implementation-approach">Requirements and Implementation Approach</h1>

<p>The specific requirements</p>

<ul>
  <li>The avatar inside breathes — scales up and down, looping infinitely</li>
  <li>Each time it scales up, a background image also scales up and fades out</li>
  <li>Tapping scales the entire background view down</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="implementation-approach">Implementation Approach</h2>

<p>First, we need to create a Layer to hold the first infinitely scaling breathing image.<br />
The background also needs a Layer with an animation group for scale-up + opacity fade, and it holds an image that scales up and fades.</p>

<p>Finally, tapping triggers it — just add a one-time scale animation.</p>

